    <string name="about_story_title">BRAND STORY</string>
    <string name="about_story_desc">In 1951, amidst rustic tea fields rich with nature fragrance, our brand was born out of genuine love for bold tea flavors. Over a lengthy path, Ngo Gia has grown into one of the most familiar and favored names by retaining consistent quality, hospitality and constant innovation to conquer modern trends of Vietnamese youth.</string>
    <string name="about_feature_quality_content_desc">Core Quality Aspect</string>
    <string name="about_feature_quality_title">Top-Tier Quality</string>
    <string name="about_feature_quality_desc">Safe, hygienic and fully flavorful. Utilizing natural, safe ingredients while guaranteeing absolute sanitation is always our highest paramount priority across Hong Tra Ngo Gia networks.</string>
    <string name="about_feature_service_content_desc">Customer Care Service</string>
    <string name="about_feature_service_title">Dedicated Service</string>
    <string name="about_feature_service_desc">Hong Tra Ngo Gia always thrives to bring ultimate satisfaction to customers via professional, warm and extremely friendly serving attitudes.</string>
    <string name="about_feature_tradition_content_desc">Inheritance and Evolution</string>
    <string name="about_feature_tradition_title">Tradition &amp; Innovation</string>
    <string name="about_feature_tradition_desc">Grounded firmly on dual core values of Quality and Service, Hong Tra Ngo Gia seamlessly updates itself to establish an enduring trustworthy brand name.</string>
    <string name="about_video_overlay">HONG TRA NGO GIA</string>
    <string name="about_mission_title">OUR MISSION</string>
    <string name="about_mission_desc">Hong Tra Ngo Gia is committed to delivering refined, wholesome and entirely safe drinks. Every single refreshing cup served encapsulates all the passion and high respect of our artisan tea brewers.</string>
